Subject: [PATCH] Add Grand Theft Auto IV profile

- games/gtaiv.conf: GTA IV 1.0.7.0 (32-bit, WoW64 + FEX), its own
  switch/gtaiv folder, name, icon and credits; the game goes in
  drive_c/GTAIV
- Command line built in: windowed 960x540, everything at minimum,
  -nomemrestrict/-availablevidmem so the game accepts DXVK's memory
- GTAIV.wine-nx.txt: DXVK, FEX with TSO, 30 fps cap
- Placeholder icon (assets/gtaiv.jpg, 256x256) to replace

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
